## Getting Started

This documentation site is built using [MkDocs](https://www.mkdocs.org/) with the TechDocs plugin for Backstage.

### Adding New Documentation

1. Create new Markdown files in the `docs/` directory
2. Update the navigation in `.backstage/mkdocs.yml` if needed
3. Commit and push your changes to the `main` branch
4. The documentation will be automatically published via GitHub Actions

### Documentation Structure

```
docs/
├── index.md          # This file
└── ...               # Additional documentation files
```

## Features

